Z||000000||toopak||08-26-99||02:40 PM||||My car's idle goes up & down about 200 rpm, otherwise runs good & gets over 20mpg.  Any help would be appreciated.
Z||000001||Stroker||08-26-99||11:01 PM||||Could be a loose throttle position sensor or a bad idle air control valve.Also check for vacuum leaks at the manifold ,vacuum solenoid ,and brake booster.
Z||000002||K9||09-01-99||10:50 PM||||What gets over looked sometimes are the little things. Start off by replacing the flowimg: set of wires, cap and router and spark pluges.  
